OL,3,GNEWSAStop selling kids flour and eggs,
OL,4,Ashops told
OL,5,
OL,6,FShops in part of Leicester have been
OL,7,Fasked to stop selling flour, eggs and
OL,8,Ftomato ketchup to children in the
OL,9,Frun-up to Halloween.
OL,11,FInvestigations into retail crime in
OL,12,FWest Leicester have led officers to
OL,13,Fnotice a rise in both the sale and the
OL,14,Ftheft of the kitchen staples to
OL,15,Fyoungsters ahead of both Halloween and
OL,16,FBonfire Night.
OL,18,FAs a result police officers have been
OL,19,Fvisiting stores to ask them to display
OL,20,Fposters stating no sales of the items
OL,21,Fwill be made to under-18s without an
OL,22,Fadult present.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
