OL,3,GNEWSAStop selling kids flour and eggs,
OL,4,Ashops told
OL,5,
OL,6,F"While we'd love to believe a sudden
OL,7,Finterest in baking has swept through
OL,8,Fthe area, we're fairly certain pancakes
OL,9,Fare not on the menu," said a
OL,10,Fspokesperson for West Leicester Police.
